### Ajouter un manhwa
POST http://localhost:3000/addManhwa
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Solo Leveling",
  "nombreDeChapitres": 200
}

### Ajouter un manhwa avec image (multipart)
# Exemple curl :
#   curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/addManhwa \
#     -F "titre=Tower of God" \
#     -F "nombreDeChapitres=550" \
#     -F "image=@/chemin/local/tog.jpg"
POST http://localhost:3000/addManhwa
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="titre"

Tower of God
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="nombreDeChapitres"

550
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="tog.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./tog.jpg
------Boundary--

### Voir tous les manhwas
GET http://localhost:3000/getAllManhwa

### Ajouter des chapitres
PATCH http://localhost:3000/manhwa/YOUR-UUID-HERE/addChapters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 5
}

### Ajouter des chapitres lus
PATCH http://localhost:3000/manhwa/YOUR-UUID-HERE/addReadChapters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 3
}

### Supprimer des chapitres
PATCH http://localhost:3000/manhwa/YOUR-UUID-HERE/removeChapters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 2
}

### Supprimer des chapitres lus
PATCH http://localhost:3000/manhwa/YOUR-UUID-HERE/removeReadChapters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 1
}

### Désactiver un manhwa
PATCH http://localhost:3000/disableManhwa/YOUR-UUID-HERE
